.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt MIDNIGHTBSD-SEARCH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm midnightbsd-search
.Nd search indexed file names and paths
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Op Fl -display Ns = Ns Ar display
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
opens the GTK 3 Search Files window.
Enter part of a file name or path and click Find or press Enter.
Search is case-insensitive and treats the text literally.
It queries the system
.Xr locate 1
database, returns at most 20 matches, and times out after 15 seconds.
Results depend on the age and availability of that database;
this application does not search file contents.
Click a result to open it with the default application.
.Pp
The application accepts standard GTK and GApplication options, including:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show available options and exit.
.It Fl -display Ns = Ns Ar display
Select the X display.
.El
There is no application-specific search term or version option;
search text is entered in the window.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev DISPLAY , XAUTHORITY
Select and authenticate to the X server.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr locate 1 ,
.Xr midnight-wm 1 ,
.Xr midnightbsd-settings 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Lucas Holt
